  "releaseNotes": "# 2.31.0 (12 November 2026)\n- #1538 Bump Microsoft.AspNetCore.WebUtilities from 2.3.0 to 2.3.14 [dependencies]\n- #1540 Bump Aspire from 13.6.4 to 13.6.5 [dependencies]\n- #1542 Upgrade dependencies [dependencies]\n- #1543 Use X509CertificateLoader on .NET 9+ [bug]\n- #1365 Client certificate authentication works with .NET 8 and fails with .NET 9 [bug]\n- #1541 WireMock.Shared depends on Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http 2.3.9 which has a high-severity vulnerability [dependencies]\n\nThe full release notes can be found here: https://github.com/wiremock/WireMock.Net/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md",
